B.abV=A.a(s(["A short tour of the essentials. Tap the screen to continue.","Colored markers show bays, marinas and piers. Tap a numbered bubble to zoom into that area.",'Filter the map by type with the chips above. With "My boat fits" on, places your boat can\'t fit are hidden.',"Share your location and your boat appears on the map; distances and sea routes are calculated from where you are.","One tap in an emergency: your coordinates, radio channels and emergency numbers \u2014 no sign-in, works offline.",'Here is a live example: we drew a real land-avoiding route off G\xf6cek. Tap a bay and press "Sea route" and the same happens \u2014 if location is off, the app asks automatically.','The example route\'s info card is above. "Add point" adds stops, dragging the white dots bends the line; the bookmark icon saves the route.',"Your routes and sailing notes now live under one roof: the Deck Log. Below is a sample route card \u2014 tapping it rebuilds the route on the map.",'Your boat\'s home: name, length, draft and home marina live here; the "My boat fits" filter uses them. Maintenance opens from a one-line summary.',"The Today tab is the day's pulse: weather, the day's summary and \"Around you\" \u2014 routes, questions and events shared by the community flow here. The starter tasks card guides your first steps.","Profile is your captain's corner: browse the community's routes with \"Route Discovery\"; your captain profile, badges and settings live here. You can share your own route from the saved routes in your deck log.","That's the tour. Now tap a bay on the map and draw your first sea route. Fair winds!"]),t.s)
